# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Base URL of the Document2Action backend API, INCLUDING any path prefix and
# WITHOUT a trailing slash. Endpoints such as `/documents` are appended to it.
#
# Authentication uses an HttpOnly session cookie set by the backend (see README).
# Cross-origin APIs must allow credentials via CORS; a same-origin path such as /api also works.
# This value is PUBLIC (embedded in the bundle) — never put secrets here.
#
# Leave unset (or empty) while there is no backend: the app then shows an
# honest "not connected" state instead of any sample data.
#
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
